 carries food all day long. When someone is lost in the mountains, it shares that food.",[22]="It carries food all day long. When someone is lost in the mountains, it shares that food.",[23]="It carries food rolled up in its tail. It has the habit of sharing food with people lost in mountains.",[24]="It carries food all day long. When someone is lost in the mountains, it shares that food.",[25]="Delibird carries its food bundled up in its tail. There once was a famous explorer who managed to reach the peak of the world’s highest mountain, thanks to one of these Pokémon sharing its food.",[26]="Delibird carries its food bundled up in its tail. There once was a famous explorer who managed to reach the peak of the world’s highest mountain, thanks to one of these Pokémon sharing its food.",[27]="Although it naturally prefers colder locales, Delibird in Alola seem able to withstand the heat to a certain extent.",[28]="It has a generous habit of sharing its food with people and Pokémon, so it’s always scrounging around for more food.",[29]="It shares its food with people who are stranded. Because Delibird is omnivorous, sometimes it gives those people bug Pokémon.",[30]="It wraps food in its tail to carry it around. The Delibird with the biggest tail is the boss of the flock!",[33]="It carries food all day long. There are tales about lost people who were saved by the food it had.",[34]="It has a generous habit of sharing its food with people and Pokémon, so it’s always scrounging around for more food."},es={[23]="Transporta alimentos en su cola enrollada. Le gusta compartir su comida con los montañistas perdidos.",[24]="Lleva siempre comida consigo. Si se encuentra con montañeros que vagan perdidos, la comparte.",[25]="Delibird usa la cola a modo de saco para llevar su alimento. En una ocasión, un famoso escalador consiguió alcanzar la cima más alta del mundo gracias a que uno de estos Pokémon compartió sus alimentos con él.",[26]="Delibird usa la cola a modo de saco para llevar su alimento. En una ocasión, un famoso escalador consiguió alcanzar la cima más alta del mundo gracias a que uno de estos Pokémon compartió sus alimentos con él.",[27]="Este Pokémon es originario de tierras frías, pero los Delibird de Alola se han adaptado sin problemas al entorno cálido de la región.",[28]="Tiene la costumbre de compartir su comida con todo el mundo, ya sea humano o Pokémon, por lo que está constantemente en busca de alimento.",[29]="Si ve a alguien en apuros, comparte su alimento con él. Aunque, al ser omnívoro, podría ser que compartiera algún que otro Pokémon insecto.",[30]="Usa la cola para transportar su alimento. El ejemplar que posea la cola de mayor tamaño se convertirá en el líder de la bandada.",[33]="Transporta comida durante todo el día. Según dicen, muchos desaparecidos han sobrevivido gracias a ella.",[34]="Tiene la costumbre de compartir su comida con todo el mundo, sea humano o Pokémon, por lo que está constantemente en busca de alimento."},pt="Tem o hábito generoso de dividir sua comida com pessoas e Pokémon, por isso está sempre procurando mais comida."},evo={{s=225}},moves={[3]={1,217},[4]={1,217},[5]={1,217},[6]={1,217},[7]={1,217},[8]={1,217},[9]={1,217},[10]={1,217},[11]={1,217},[12]={1,217},[13]={1,217},[14]={1,217},[15]={1,217},[16]={1,217},[17]={1,217,25,65},[18]={1,217,25,65},[20]={1,217,25,65},[23]={1,217,25,65},[25]={1,217,25,65}},enc={[12]={166,1,32,32,40},[13]={166,1,32,32,40},[14]={167,1,32,33,40},[16]={244,1,22,22,20,245,1,22,22,20,246,1,23,23,20,247,1,23,23,20},[10]={497,1,30,30,5,498,1,30,30,5},[17]={615,1,48,48,10,617,1,58,58,10},[18]={615,1,48,48,10,617,1,58,58,10},[21]={614,1,44,44,5,614,8,49,49,5,615,1,47,47,5,616,1,44,44,5,616,8,49,49,5,617,1,44,44,5,617,8,49,49,5,705,1,39,39,5,705,8,44,44,5},[22]={614,1,44,44,5,614,8,49,49,5,615,1,47,47,5,616,1,44,44,5,616,8,49,49,5,617,1,44,44,5,617,8,49,49,5,705,1,39,39,5,705,8,44,44,5},[23]={728,17,38,40,40,1333,1,30,30,33},[24]={728,17,38,40,40,1333,1,30,30,33},[5